  "description": "2 Notes To Be Aware Of",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and happy Monday everyone. We are proceeding into week 10 of the bull market. For those that have been out of the loop, 2 quick notes:</p><ol><li><p>When will you buy more? </p><ol><li><p>When price action is working for us. Currently we have 5 positions. I want to see those positions get into more green to confirm we have an<em><strong> overall market trend</strong></em> on our side, and that picking up more individual names is favorable. You do not need to FOMO into stocks when they are draining your capital or your sanity. You are just adding more risk. When we did baby step approach into the market back in March and April, recall, by being patient, we outperformed most fund managers in ~6 weeks. No point in being in if the market is working against you. </p></li></ol></li></ol>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Good morning and happy Monday everyone. We are proceeding into week 10 of the bull market. For those that have been out of the loop, 2 quick notes:",
